---
title: Nutty Crunch Arugula Salad
description: A bright side made to go with aglio e olio.
course: side
cuisine: italian
servings: 4
time_active: 10
time_total: 10
leftovers: poor
tags: [quick]
pairs: [prosciutto-mozzarella-garlic-bread]
---

Toast @walnuts{1/4%cup}(roughly chopped, or pine nuts) in a dry #skillet{} over medium heat, stirring, until fragrant and golden, ~{2-3%minutes}. Let cool.

Whisk @extra virgin olive oil{3%tbsp}, the juice of @lemon{1/2}(about 1 tbsp), @honey{1%tsp}, @salt{1/4%tsp}, and @black pepper{1/8%tsp}.

Combine @arugula{4%cups} and @cucumber{1}(thinly sliced into half-moons) in a large bowl. Top with @feta cheese{1/3%cup}(crumbled) and the walnuts.

Just before serving, toss with the vinaigrette.
